<tr><td>Pricing Value</td><td>⭐⭐⭐</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>Make</td><td>Cheaper per operation at volume; more generous free allowance</td></tr>
<tr><td>Workflow Flexibility</td><td>⭐⭐⭐</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>Make</td><td>Routers, iterators, aggregators, custom error handling</td></tr>
<tr><td>Integration Count</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>Zapier</td><td>8,000+ apps — best ecosystem coverage</td></tr>
<tr><td>AI Capabilities</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>Tie</td><td>Zapier broader; Make deeper native AI</td></tr>
<tr><td>Data Transformation</td><td>⭐⭐⭐</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>Make</td><td>Native iterators, aggregators, visual mapping</td></tr>
<tr><td>Error Handling</td><td>⭐⭐⭐</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>Make</td><td>Per-module handlers, configurable retries</td></tr>
<tr><td>Learning Curve</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>⭐⭐⭐</td><td>Zapier</td><td>Non-technical teams productive in minutes</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h2>Recommendation Matrix</h2>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Your Profile</th><th>Recommended</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
